# FIELD_VALIDATION_RAW — PE_935_NIF_10_1_BASELINE_ROSETTA_R1 (§9 evidence)

All numbers from run-local artifacts: WORLD_SLICE_VALIDATION.json (single
ALL-pass, hypothesis_sha 6DB2F1E37E900A2573FEE07B5945B5E25B438066EA0A26AF0841540C96693752),
TYPE_CENSUS_SUMMARY.json, PARSER_MANIFEST_CROSSCHECK.json, CROSS_PUBLISHER_TEST.json.

## METHOD (per §19 for every PASS claim)

- MEASURED_QUANTITY: full-file structural closure = header + per-block
  [GroupID u32 + class fields per pinned baseline] + TopObjects + EOF-exact,
  computed by the run-local table-driven decoder (s06) over the schema-driven
  baseline (s04/HIST) with closure-constrained boundary search for the 4
  variable Ark blocks.
- INDEPENDENT_SOURCE_OF_TRUTH: physical Models.bnt bytes (SRC-15) + pinned
  external oracles (schema HIST/MOD, engine source) — never R61/manifest/
  NifModelReader.js (parser echo excluded; see NEGATIVE_CONTROL_RAW.md).
- WHY_NON_CIRCULAR: the census and the closure decoder were built before
  any comparison to parser outputs; the per-file census MATCH with the
  parser manifest (4838/4838) is a POST-HOC cross-check; scrambled-input
  controls prove byte-dependence.
- FAILURE_CASE_DETECTED: any desync/NaN/Inf/OOB-ref/array-cap → file FAIL
  recorded with reason (2363-candidate denominators; 20 failures listed).

