## Layout-variant decisions (LAYOUT_VARIANTS mechanism)

NiVertexColorProperty: 'schema' variant won every time it was tried
(2,544 wins; 'u16x3_u32' alternative never required — the two splits are
width-identical; ambiguity DISCLOSED, not resolved by closure).

## ArkTexture count-source resolution (closure search)

Accepted count sources: numfield(=3) 168 files; field1 1,206; field2>>8 969.
These reflect CLOSURE truth, not source semantics: post-hoc verification:
field2>>8 == accepted count in 2,319/2,343 (99.0%). The 24-block variant
family (count from field1/numfield; f1=15/0x1000000 entries; garbage refs)
is a NEW open finding — recommended for a bounded follow-up.

## Known-N limitations (explicit)

- NiSpecularProperty 14, NiShadeProperty 1, NiDitherProperty 9, NiFogProperty
  1, NiSortAdjustNode 1, NiCollisionData 12, NiPixelData 1: validated at
  small N or deferred (NiPixelData/NiSourceTexture outside slice).
- 45 non-slice types: layout NOT byte-validated this run (see coverage
  matrix); their rows carry UNKNOWN/deferred status with census
  denominators.
